# Prettier is not a dependency of this repo; it runs from the maintainer's
# editor hook. These paths are hand-formatted or generated: formatting them
# rewrites whole files (e2e specs are written with long lines) or changes
# what Markdown renders (docs/spec: DEVICE_NETWORKS ... _write_ turns into
# broken emphasis). See also .prettierrc: .prettierignore is resolved from the
# working directory, so the same paths carry requirePragma there, which holds
# from any directory.
docs/spec/
e2e/
testdata/
**/testdata/
design/
internal/tasmotacmd/*.json
internal/web/static/htmx-*.js
site/
deploy/grafana/
